ed via /v1/api/app/lineups/soccer/{matchId}?locale=en","Scoreboard data is fetched via /v1/api/app/scoreboard/soccer/{matchId}?locale=en","Logic identified in enhanced-match-scraper.ts and smart-enhancer-simplified.ts","Smart enhancer uses a deduplicator cache for lineups and scoreboard retrieval"],"files":["src/lib/scraping/enhanced-match-scraper.ts","src/lib/scraping/smart-enhancer-simplified.ts"],"id":"obs_mpuf84y4_cb696d5319cb","importance":4,"narrative":"Performed a code search to identify where the application consumes match-specific endpoints. Found that both enhanced-match-scraper and smart-enhancer-simplified handle these requests using consistent API URL patterns, with the latter implementing explicit caching logic.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Grepping for lineup and scoreboard scraping logic","timestamp":"2026-05-31T23:38:47.667Z","title":"Locate match details endpoint implementations","type":"search"},"obs_mpuf85bu_f257c0e16a91":{"concepts":["API reverse engineering","web scraping","data acquisition pattern"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Base URL: https://prod-cdn-public-api.livescore.com","API Pattern: /v1/api/app/stage/soccer/{competition}/{stage_id}?locale=en&amp;MD=1","Stage ID '3' identified as a generic season/stage identifier for all competitions","Verified scraping targets include Premier League, La Liga, Serie A, Bundesliga, Ligue 1, and Liga 1"],"files":["src/lib/scraping/discovered-api-patterns.ts"],"id":"obs_mpuf85bu_f257c0e16a91","importance":5,"narrative":"Read the documentation of discovered API endpoints for the livescore scraper to understand how to construct valid requests for soccer data. This confirms the URL structure and confirms that the '3' suffix is a reliable parameter for targeting the correct data stage across different leagues.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Examining reverse-engineered API endpoints for soccer data scraping","timestamp":"2026-05-31T23:38:48.161Z","title":"Read Livescore API discovery patterns","type":"file_read"},"obs_mpuf8ax8_13973c360870":{"concepts":["web scraping","data normalization","date parsing","TypeScript interfaces"],"confidence":1,"facts":["api-scraper.ts processes LivescoreAPIMatch objects with keys Eid, T1, T2, Tr1, Tr2, Eps, and Esd.","enhanced-match-scraper.ts handles database operations for match data including eventDate and goal statistics.","Dates are parsed in api-scraper.ts using event.Esd string representation."],"files":["src/lib/scraping/api-scraper.ts","src/lib/scraping/enhanced-match-scraper.ts"],"id":"obs_mpuf8ax8_13973c360870","importance":3,"narrative":"Performed a codebase search to identify how match events and incidents are currently structured and processed. The search confirmed that api-scraper.ts handles raw API objects while enhanced-match-scraper.ts interacts with the database layer.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Investigating event parsing in api-scraper.ts and enhanced-match-scraper.ts","timestamp":"2026-05-31T23:38:55.410Z","title":"Search for match event data structures","type":"search"},"obs_mpuf8bvt_79e6a6dd1784":{"concepts":["caching pattern","rate limiting","data deduplication","web scraping"],"confidence":1,"facts":["enhanceMatch implements deduplication for lineups, h2h, standings, and scoreboard data.","enhanceMatch uses a custom deduplicator and rateLimiter for API calls.","enhanceUpcomingMatches iterates through matches with a 1500ms delay between requests.","The system uses specific cache keys based on matchId and competition identifiers."],"files":["src/lib/scraping/smart-enhancer-simplified.ts"],"id":"obs_mpuf8bvt_79e6a6dd1784","importance":3,"narrative":"Analyzed the match enhancement logic which coordinates data fetching for sports matches. The implementation prioritizes cache utilization via a deduplicator and implements sequential processing with rate limiting to manage external API constraints.","sessionId":"348be0