"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Created MatchStats.tsx to display side-by-side match statistics using a bar-chart visualization.","Component maps over a defined ROWS config to render dynamic bar components for metrics like possession, shots, and cards.","Calculates percentage splits for visualization based on home vs away team values.","Handles null values with a graceful \"—\" display and handles empty state/missing data."],"files":["/Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/src/components/react/meciuri/MatchStats.tsx"],"id":"obs_mpufrbfy_9fba3a3f5fcd","importance":4,"narrative":"I created the MatchStats component to visualize team-level match data. The component uses a dynamic configuration array to render progress-bar style comparisons between home and away team stats, ensuring clean presentation of metrics like xG, possession, and various match events.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Implemented statistical comparison visualizer","timestamp":"2026-05-31T23:53:42.547Z","title":"Created MatchStats component","type":"file_write"},"obs_mpufrink_f5a2a3e43d6e":{"concepts":["React component composition","Interface definition","Data flow refactoring"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Imported MatchEvents, MatchLineups, and MatchStats components.","Added MatchDetailsPayload interface for events, lineups, and stats.","Updated SingleMatchAppProps to include the optional details payload."],"files":["/Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/src/components/react/meciuri/SingleMatchApp.tsx"],"id":"obs_mpufrink_f5a2a3e43d6e","importance":5,"narrative":"The SingleMatchApp component was updated to integrate new display components for match events, lineups, and statistics. This architecture allows the component to accept pre-fetched match details in addition to the initial match data.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Added MatchEvents, MatchLineups, and MatchStats to SingleMatchApp component","timestamp":"2026-05-31T23:53:51.894Z","title":"Update SingleMa