pping. The lack of output suggests these identifiers are not explicitly used in this module, potentially requiring a broader search or different field names.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Grep search for schema identifiers","timestamp":"2026-06-01T12:15:39.868Z","title":"Search for shortName usage in assign-competitions.ts","type":"command_run"},"obs_mpv69icv_545048e1e782":{"concepts":["data pipeline","code search","API data mapping"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Located multiple 'name' field entries within src/pages/api/data-pipeline/pull-raw.ts","Entries follow a pattern of league names and stage-specific labels (e.g., \"Regular Season\", \"Playoff\")","World Cup 2026 names are dynamically generated using template literals"],"files":["src/pages/api/data-pipeline/pull-raw.ts"],"id":"obs_mpv69icv_545048e1e782","importance":3,"narrative":"Performed a grep search to map existing league and competition naming conventions within the data pipeline. This identifies the data structure used for tournament classification in the API layer.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Identifying naming conventions for data pipeline entities","timestamp":"2026-06-01T12:15:41.337Z","title":"Search for name identifiers in pull-raw.ts","type":"search"},"obs_mpv69lxb_4b81ae239b93":{"concepts":["data-pipeline","api-route","batch-processing"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Competition objects are pushed to allCompetitions array at line 486","rawDataEntries contains structure for matches, teams, and competitions starting at line 517","The pipeline iterates through rawDataEntries using a for-of loop starting at line 547"],"files":["src/pages/api/data-pipeline/pull-raw.ts"],"id":"obs_mpv69lxb_4b81ae239b93","importance":4,"narrative":"The search confirmed how competition data is aggregated and mapped into rawData structures within the API pipeline. This provides the necessary context for identifying where data transformation or storage occurs i