cessing logic","type":"file_read"},"obs_mpv6suan_962ac7842f0f":{"concepts":["data-pipeline","API route handler","Drizzle ORM","data normalization"],"confidence":1,"facts":["The API endpoint inserts raw teams and competitions into the 'importRawData' database table.","Proxy statistics are logged and returned in the success response.","Helper functions include 'extractTeamName', 'parseEventDate' (with 8-14 digit parsing), and 'mapEventStatus'.","Error handling returns a 500 status code with an error message."],"files":["/Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/src/pages/api/data-pipeline/pull-raw.ts"],"id":"obs_mpv6suan_962ac7842f0f","importance":3,"narrative":"Inspected the tail end of the data pipeline API handler, specifically the database insertion loop and utility helper functions. These helpers manage data normalization for teams, dates, and event statuses, which is critical for the integrity of the downstream raw data ingestion process.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Inspecting data insertion and status mapping in pull-raw.ts","timestamp":"2026-06-01T12:30:43.269Z","title":"Read data pipeline raw pulling API logic","type":"file_read"},"obs_mpv6u6d5_516d49c27de6":{"concepts":["API Integration","Data Pipeline","Astro API Routes","Drizzle ORM","ETL Process"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Endpoint implemented at /src/pages/api/data-pipeline/pull-by-date.ts","Uses Livescore API (v1/api/app/date/soccer) to fetch match data by date","Writes processed payloads to import_raw_data table with 'pending' status","Includes filtering logic for countries (Ccd) and date range support"],"files":["src/pages/api/data-pipeline/pull-by-date.ts"],"id":"obs_mpv6u6d5_516d49c27de6","importance":6,"narrative":"Created a new Astro API endpoint to serve as a data pipeline trigger for fetching soccer match data from Livescore. This module handles date parsing, Livescore-specific status mapping, and ensures the output schema is compatible with existing batch processing pipelines for downstream database ingestion.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Added pull-by-date API for external data ingestion","timestamp":"2026-06-01T12:31:45.568Z","title":"Created Livescore Data Pipeline Endpoint","type":"file_write"},"obs_mpv6uaxu_3721689b0e44":{"concepts":["API integration","data ingestion","pipeline monitoring"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Successfully fetched data for 2026-06-01 through 2026-06-05","Total matches processed: 361","Operation completed in 1 second","Generated raw IDs for matches and teams retrieval"],"files":["/api/data-pipeline/pull-by-date"],"id":"obs_mpv6uaxu_3721689b0e44","importance":4,"narrative":"The data pipeline was triggered via an HTTP POST request to ingest sports data for a 5-day window starting June 1st, 2026. The pipeline successfully processed the date range, returning statistics on matches, competitions, and teams for each day.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"API request to /api/data-pipeline/pull-by-date","timestamp":"2026-06-01T12:31:51.499Z","title":"Triggered data pipeline pull for 5-day range","type":"command_run"},"obs_mpv6upx0_4c4c61392fcb":{"concepts":["API automation","Data synchronization","Pipeline execution"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Teams: 606 new created, 0 updated, 0 errors","Competitions: 87 new created, 2 updated, 0 errors","Matches: 314 new, 3339 updated, 1 foreign key error"],"files":[],"id":"obs_mpv6upx0_4c4c61392fcb","importance":6,"narrative":"Executed the three-stage data assignment pipeline via local API endpoints. The process successfully synchronized the majority of records, identifying a single foreign key error during the match assignment phase that requires investigation.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Triggered team, competition, and match assignment endpoints","timestamp":"2026-06-01T12:32:10.907Z","title":"Execution of data-assignment pipeline","type":"command_run"},"obs_mpv6v4cj_5299607f3c57":{"concepts":["Astro framework","data synchronization","live polling","server-side rendering"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Changed criteria for calling enhanceMatchDetails to ensure live matches re-fetch data on every page load.","Retained existing conditional logic for finished matches that only trigger enhancement if data is currently empty.","Maintained try-catch block to prevent runtime crashes during data enhancement."],"files":["/Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/src/pages/meciuri/[id].astro"],"id":"obs_mpv6v4cj_5299607f3c57","importance":5,"narrative":"The enhancement logic was modified to ensure live match details are consistently updated during every page load. By separating the logic for 'finished' matches (only enhance if empty) from 'live' matches (always re-pull for live updates), the application now provides real-time data for ongoing matches while minimizing unnecessary API calls for completed ones.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Modify [id].astro to improve live match data synchronization","timestamp":"2026-06-01T12:32:29.609Z","title":"Update match data auto-enhance logic","type":"file_edit"},"obs_mpv6vi2d_7bc4e0f8069b":{"concepts":["Astro API Routes","Drizzle ORM","Concurrency Control","Data Pipeline"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Endpoint iterates through all matches with 'live' status","Implements a custom concurrency-limited runner (default: 4, range: 1-8)","Uses Drizzle ORM and postgres-js for database operations","Calls enhanceMatchDetails for each live match"],"files":["src/pages/api/data-pipeline/enhance-live.ts"],"id":"obs_mpv6vi2d_7bc4e0f8069b","importance":6,"narrative":"Created a new Astro API endpoint designed to be triggered by a cron job. It batches processing of live match details to maintain performance while updating events and stats for ongoing games.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"src/pages/api/data-pipeline/enhance-live.ts","timestamp":"2026-06-01T12:32:47.388Z","title":"Created live match enhancement API endpoint","type":"file_write"},"obs_mpv6vnl7_3c571426117a":{"concepts":["cron job","bash scripting","API configuration","data-pipeline"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Added API_ENDPOINT_ENHANCE_LIVE=\"/api/data-pipeline/enhance-live\" to configuration block.","The script manages automated synchronization and live-match notification cycles.","Target file: /Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/scripts/cron/live-match-cron.sh"],"files":["/Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/scripts/cron/live-match-cron.sh"],"id":"obs_mpv6vnl7_3c571426117a","importance":4,"narrative":"Updated the cron script configuration to include a new API endpoint reference for data enhancement. This change prepares the script for an upcoming integration with the data pipeline for live matches.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Added API_ENDPOINT_ENHANCE_LIVE variable","timestamp":"2026-06-01T12:32:54.547Z","title":"Update live-match-cron.sh configuration","type":"file_edit"},"obs_mpv6vvt8_ce74765e82e7":{"concepts":["bash automation","cron job","data pipeline","API orchestration"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Script updated: /Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/scripts/cron/live-match-cron.sh","Added HTTP POST request to API_ENDPOINT_ENHANCE_LIVE with concurrency:4","Implemented parsing of JSON response fields \"processed\" and \"succeeded\"","Added logging to track enhancement progress and debug failures"],"files":["/Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/scripts/cron/live-match-cron.sh"],"id":"obs_mpv6vvt8_ce74765e82e7","importance":5,"narrative":"The cron job script was updated to trigger a data enhancement pipeline after the initial score synchronization. This ensures that detailed match data like events, lineups, and stats are processed while the \"is_live\" flags are current.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Added API call to /api/data-pipeline/enhance-live","timestamp":"2026-06-01T12:33:05.196Z","title":"Integrate live match data enhancement into