cific leagues","timestamp":"2026-06-01T12:52:45.380Z","title":"Query competition mappings in PostgreSQL","type":"command_run"},"obs_mpv7lngl_ba3a3b097e3d":{"concepts":["SQL","Data Auditing","PostgreSQL"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Database: scoru","Target countries: Italy, France, Germany","Query result: Only 1 German competition (Bundesliga) found"],"files":[],"id":"obs_mpv7lngl_ba3a3b097e3d","importance":4,"narrative":"Executed a SQL query to audit sports_competitions data for Italy, France, and Germany. The results indicate a significant lack of competition entries for these regions, suggesting missing data in the database.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Checking for missing competition data in target countries","timestamp":"2026-06-01T12:53:07.435Z","title":"Query sports competitions for IT/FR/DE","type":"command_run"},"obs_mpv7m7wy_82ad0434ccb1":{"concepts":["PostgreSQL","data mapping","entity resolution","database introspection"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Query filtered for competition entity_type with various league name keywords.","Identified 4 mappings: bundesliga_2024_25, la_liga_2024_25, premier_league_2024, and premier_league_2024_25.","Confirmed internal_id mapping for Premier League duplication."],"files":[],"id":"obs_mpv7m7wy_82ad0434ccb1","importance":5,"narrative":"Executed a SQL query to verify existing competition mappings within the import_entity_mappings table. The results reveal multiple entries for the Premier League, highlighting potential data consistency or ingestion redundancy issues.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Database query for competition entity ID correlations","timestamp":"2026-06-01T12:53:33.942Z","title":"Inspect competition mappings in import_entity_mappings table","type":"command_run"},"obs_mpv7nvps_22da99863501":{"concepts":["data normalization","slug generation","data collision prevention","identifier engineering"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Introduced a `slugify` 