tion","Type-safe refactoring"],"confidence":0.9,"facts":["Updated teamIdFor calls to include 'country' argument.","Modified /src/pages/api/data-pipeline/pull-by-date.ts to align with updated team lookup requirements."],"files":["/Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/src/pages/api/data-pipeline/pull-by-date.ts"],"id":"obs_mpv7o3dv_b92932afb32a","importance":5,"narrative":"The team resolution helper 'teamIdFor' required the 'country' parameter to properly scope team lookups, preventing ID collisions or mismatches. The API pipeline was updated to pass the available 'country' context when resolving home and away team IDs from Livescore data.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Injecting country context into team resolution logic","timestamp":"2026-06-01T12:55:01.368Z","title":"Update teamIdFor signature in data-pipeline","type":"file_edit"},"obs_mpv7omir_5b0522b9d7bd":{"concepts":["API integration","data synchronization","pipeline monitoring"],"confidence":1,"facts":["API endpoint: http://localhost:4321/api/data-pipeline/run","Total matches processed: 3293","Total teams processed: 819","Total competitions processed: 33","Failed operations: 0"],"files":[],"id":"obs_mpv7omir_5b0522b9d7bd","importance":4,"narrative":"The data pipeline was triggered via an HTTP POST request to ensure current data synchronization. The output was parsed using Python to confirm successful processing of records without errors.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Execution of pull-raw via API with success metrics verification","timestamp":"2026-06-01T12:55:26.184Z","title":"Re-run data pipeline and verify sync","type":"command_run"},"obs_mpv7opne_e5f1ed4b4231":{"concepts":["PostgreSQL","Correlated subquery","Data validation"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Retrieved match counts per competition via correlated subquery in `sports_matches`","37 competitions identified across various regions including England, Europe, France, Germany, International, Italy, R