tch helper to map API data to a unified Match schema","Calculated daily match statistics (live, upcoming, finished) for client-side hydration","Introduced editorial stadium header design with CSS-in-JS style variables"],"files":["src/pages/meciuri/index.astro"],"id":"obs_mpv8ik34_d153adf7c334","importance":5,"narrative":"The match index page was initialized using Astro's server-side rendering to fetch and unify match data before rendering. A transformation layer ensures consistent schema usage for the React-based MatchesApp component, while initial stats are pre-calculated for immediate display.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Implemented Astro SSR for matches index page","timestamp":"2026-06-01T13:18:42.704Z","title":"Initialize Meciuri page with SSR and data transformation","type":"file_edit"},"obs_mpv8inoz_950dcc2fede9":{"concepts":["nanostores","state management","date formatting","reactive atoms"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Uses nanostores for reactive state","$currentDate atom holds current Date object","$dateDisplays provides computed formatting and status flags","Includes navigation actions: goToPreviousDay, goToNextDay, goToToday, goToDate","Uses ro-RO locale for date formatting"],"files":["src/lib/stores/date-navigation-store.ts"],"id":"obs_mpv8inoz_950dcc2fede9","importance":3,"narrative":"Read the date-navigation-store implementation to understand how date-based application state is handled. The store uses nanostores atoms and computed properties to manage date selection and display logic, including conditional UI strings.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Examining state management for date navigation","timestamp":"2026-06-01T13:18:47.376Z","title":"Read date-navigation-store.ts","type":"file_read"},"obs_mpv8iq7t_dcaedf737a16":{"concepts":["Intl.DateTimeFormat","date localization","utility patterns"],"confidence":1,"facts":["File contains dateUtils object with date and time formatting helpers."