ect when match data is unavailable","Used @nanostores/react for reactive match state management"],"files":["src/components/react/meciuri/MatchHeader.tsx"],"id":"obs_mpv8sd91_b17153c306cd","importance":5,"narrative":"I implemented the MatchHeader component to act as a lightweight breadcrumb strip. It dynamically resolves competition country codes into 3-letter tags and provides a back-link to the main matches page, replacing the previously oversized header with a more editorial, functional layout.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Added breadcrumb navigation and competition metadata display","timestamp":"2026-06-01T13:26:20.410Z","title":"Implemented MatchHeader component with country code logic","type":"file_write"},"obs_mpv8t1y2_b0650b6e43e0":{"concepts":["Nanostores integration","Tailwind CSS","Component state management","Responsive design"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Component consumes global match state via Nanostores","Implements dynamic styling based on match status (live, finished, scheduled)","Includes radial gradient \"stadium light\" visual effect","Uses Intl.DateTimeFormat for locale-aware date rendering"],"files":["src/components/react/meciuri/MatchStatusCard.tsx"],"id":"obs_mpv8t1y2_b0650b6e43e0","importance":5,"narrative":"Created the MatchStatusCard component to provide an editorial view of match scores. The component handles state transitions for live matches, including a custom live indicator and atmospheric background styling.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Editorial scoreboard component with live match status","timestamp":"2026-06-01T13:26:52.414Z","title":"Implement MatchStatusCard component","type":"file_write"},"obs_mpv8tqs9_568d50706beb":{"concepts":["React component","Data visualization","CSS Grid","Localization","Tailwind CSS"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Implemented MatchEvents component for rendering chronological match data.","Used GLYPH and LABEL_RO maps to localize and symbolize event types (goals, cards, substitutions).","Defined custom dynamic glyph coloring via glyphColor utility.","Used CSS grid for a dual-column layout separated by a central timeline line."],"files":["src/components/react/meciuri/MatchEvents.tsx"],"id":"obs_mpv8tqs9_568d50706beb","importance":5,"narrative":"I created the MatchEvents component to visualize match highlights like goals and cards using a timeline format. It uses specific design tokens for consistent branding and maps event types to localized labels and symbols to ensure a clean, responsive UI.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Visualizing match timeline events with custom glyphs and labels","timestamp":"2026-06-01T13:27:24.604Z","title":"Create MatchEvents component","type":"file_edit"},"obs_mpv8uaj8_56921455bb36":{"concepts":["React component architecture","Data visualization","TypeScript interfaces","Tailwind CSS grid layout"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Created MatchStats component to visualize comparative team statistics (possession, shots, etc.).","Implemented a dynamic Bar visualization component calculating percentage split based on team stats.","Included an 'invert' configuration for metrics where lower values are preferred (e.g., fouls).","Data schema defined in StatRow interface covering possession, xG, cards, and shots."],"files":["src/components/react/meciuri/MatchStats.tsx"],"id":"obs_mpv8uaj8_56921455bb36","importance":5,"narrative":"The MatchStats component was implemented to provide a head-to-head breakdown of match metrics. It processes the raw stat array, splits data by team, and renders a visual comparison bar that highlights the \"winning\" side for each metric.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Comparative statistics view for match events","timestamp":"2026-06-01T13:27:50.201Z","title":"Implement MatchStats component","type":"file_write"},"obs_mpv8urdz_b8c0863ac8f0":{"concepts":["React component architecture","Tailwind CSS responsive design","Data visualization"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Added MatchLineups component to display team lineups split by starters and substitutes.","Implemented POS constant mapping for position codes and role colors.","Utilized tailwind CSS for grid-based responsive layout (1-column mobile, 2-column desktop).","Added logic to parse player ratings and categorise into high/mid/low tiers."],"files":["src/components/react/meciuri/MatchLineups.tsx"],"id":"obs_mpv8urdz_b8c0863ac8f0","importance":5,"narrative":"I implemented the MatchLineups component to visualize squad information for sports matches. It dynamically filters players into starters and reserves based on team IDs and provides styled rows with jersey numbers, player names, and position labels.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Refactoring UI for display of team lineups and player data","timestamp":"2026-06-01T13:28:12.044Z","title":"Implement MatchLineups Component","type":"file_edit"},"obs_mpv8vijv_457687ecbb2b":{"concepts":["Nanostores","Custom Events","React useEffect","Conditional UI rendering"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Component uses @nanostores/react for state management via $singleMatch.","Implements a custom event \"openPredictionModal\" triggered by a DOM button click.","Conditional rendering based on match status (\"scheduled\", \"live\", \"finished\").","Uses CSS variables for branding (--sb-ink, --sb-accent, --sb-paper)."],"files":["src/components/react/meciuri/MatchActions.tsx"],"id":"obs_mpv8vijv_457687ecbb2b","importance":5,"narrative":"The MatchActions component was implemented to handle editorial call-to-actions based on match status. It includes a responsive UI layout with a custom event trigger for opening a prediction modal, ensuring a consistent user experience for authenticated users.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Added editorial CTA strip for match predictions","timestamp":"2026-06-01T13:28:47.249Z","title":"Implemented Ma