ative scoring)","Live page to include global stats and AI vs User live predictions","Leaderboard strategy: Dedicated page + compact widget (avoiding mobile strip)","Season/reward model proposed: Monthly resets with prizes for top users"],"files":[],"id":"obs_mpv9n9wv_427e081b9844","importance":8,"narrative":"The user clarified the product vision, emphasizing a competitive dynamic between human users and AI. We established the core UI patterns for the homepage, betting flow, and leaderboard, prioritizing a \"betting coupon\" system and a gamified arena feel to drive engagement.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Defining core game mechanics for the AI vs User betting platform","timestamp":"2026-06-01T13:50:22.421Z","title":"Product requirements and feature scope definition","type":"decision"},"obs_mpv9ss06_8e18f6bd0184":{"concepts":["Gamification","Mobile UX design","Product roadmap","Feature scoping"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Seasons will follow a monthly cycle with promotional/relegation leagues (Bronze to Galactic).","Challenge implementation scope set to \"Solo vs AI\" + \"Battle Royale\".","Mobile Leaderboard will use a 40px floating pill with a bottom-sheet drawer.","Leaderboard pill visibility constrained to specific public pages and hides on scroll-down."],"files":[],"id":"obs_mpv9ss06_8e18f6bd0184","importance":8,"narrative":"The project scope and UX patterns were finalized through user consultation. We confirmed an incremental approach for challenges and a specific mobile-first design pattern for the leaderboard integration.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Decisions for Seasons, Challenges, and Mobile Leaderboard","timestamp":"2026-06-01T13:54:39.148Z","title":"Product requirements and mobile UX design confirmation","type":"decision"},"obs_mpv9tyrr_507d1915421d":{"concepts":["PostgreSQL","Database Schema Inspection","psql CLI"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Target database: scoru","Query attempted: cou