ch data from the Livescore API. The request resulted in a 404 error, indicating that the retrieved ID is incorrect or the endpoint structure/parameters are invalid.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Attempted to retrieve Liverpool FC data using external_id","timestamp":"2026-06-01T14:35:29.909Z","title":"Probe Livescore team API endpoint","type":"command_run"},"obs_mpvbavlk_4263c9e5c81d":{"concepts":["API integration","data-driven UI","dynamic routing","CDN asset management"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Scope: Implemented index page and dynamic detail page (/echipe/[slug])","Team rosters will use 'coming soon' placeholders for now","Goal: Extract and display team logos from Livescore API CDN","Data source: All team statistics to be calculated server-side from match scores"],"files":["/echipe","/echipe/[slug]"],"id":"obs_mpvbavlk_4263c9e5c81d","importance":7,"narrative":"The project scope for the '/echipe' section was finalized to include both the directory index and individual team detail pages. For visual assets, the decision was made to attempt external logo integration via the Livescore API instead of using placeholders, accepting the risk of discovering the required CDN base URL.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Decided on full route structure and external logo sourcing","timestamp":"2026-06-01T14:36:43.204Z","title":"Defined project scope for /echipe implementation","type":"decision"},"obs_mpvbb516_cc42f5a1979c":{"concepts":["CDN discovery","API integration","curl network testing","asset retrieval"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Target image path: teambadge/liverpool-2024.png","Confirmed valid CDN: https://lsm-static-prod.livescore.com/medium","Confirmed valid CDN: https://lsm-static-prod.livescore.com/high","Failed endpoints: https://static.livescore.com/i2 and https://lpc.livescore.com/medium"],"files":[],"id":"obs_mpvbb516_cc42f5a1979c","importance":5,"narrative":"Executed a bash script to fetch a live image path from the Livescore API and tested multiple potential CDN base URLs. Successfully verified that 'lsm-static-prod.livescore.com' is the correct host for team badge retrieval, returning 200 OK statuses.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Probing CDN endpoints for team badge image assets","timestamp":"2026-06-01T14:36:55.454Z","title":"Identify Livescore CDN base URL","type":"command_run"},"obs_mpvbbe3a_c681fc82b518":{"concepts":["PostgreSQL","JSONB","Data inspection"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Query confirmed external_data is empty or inaccessible for 'Liverpool FC' team mapping.","Target table: import_entity_mappings.","The jsonb_typeof query returned NULL for external_data, suggesting it might be null or the row is not found as expected."],"files":[],"id":"obs_mpvbbe3a_c681fc82b518","importance":5,"narrative":"Attempted to extract image paths from external_data in the scoru database to verify mapping integrity. The query returned empty values and null types, indicating that the data is not structured as assumed or the targeted rows contain insufficient data.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Debugging empty external_data for Liverpool FC team mapping","timestamp":"2026-06-01T14:37:07.193Z","title":"Inspect import_entity_mappings schema","type":"command_run"},"obs_mpvbbjm3_ef4c3caf3833":{"concepts":["PostgreSQL","JSONB","Data validation","Schema exploration"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Verified that 'raw_api_data'->'T1'->0->>'Img' contains valid filenames.","Query confirmed existence of team images for 'FCV Farul Constanta', 'Hermannstadt', 'Sepsi OSK', 'UTA Arad', and 'FCSB'.","Schema uses JSONB path expressions within 'import_raw_data' table."],"files":[],"id":"obs_mpvbbjm3_ef4c3caf3833","importance":4,"narrative":"Executed a SQL query to inspect the structure of team image paths stored within JSONB blobs in the 'import_raw_data' table. The query successfully retrieved the image paths, confirming the data format required for future image processing tasks.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"PostgreSQL query validation for JSONB structure","timestamp":"2026-06-01T14:37:14.353Z","title":"Verify team image data in raw matches","type":"command_run"},"obs_mpvbbw1w_dd7c63b05d21":{"concepts":["database migration","data normalization","maintenance script","PostgreSQL"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Script extracts badge filenames (Img) from raw_data matches (T1/T2).","Constructs URLs using base CDN: https://lsm-static-prod.livescore.com/medium/","Implements a dry-run mode and an --apply flag for DB updates.","Uses postgres.js for database interaction."],"files":["scripts/maintenance/backfill-team-logos.ts"],"id":"obs_mpvbbw1w_dd7c63b05d21","importance":5,"narrative":"Created a maintenance script to backfill team logos by parsing historical raw match data. The script maps team names to their associated badge assets and performs bulk updates on the sports_teams table to ensure data consistency across the team registry.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Scripts to populate sports_teams.logo_url from raw match data","timestamp":"2026-06-01T14:37:30.472Z","title":"Created team logo backfill script","type":"file_write"},"obs_mpvbc0gd_aec857b8a809":{"concepts":["database migration","data backfill","scripting","maintenance task"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Script identified 1469 total teams","1444 teams have valid logo mappings identified","25 teams lack corresponding badge mappings","Execution confirmed ready for --apply flag"],"files":["scripts/maintenance/backfill-team-logos.ts"],"id":"obs_mpvbc0gd_aec857b8a809","importance":5,"narrative":"The backfill script successfully parsed raw mapping data and identified 1444 updates for team logos. The process was performed as a dry run, confirming the data integrity before applying changes to the production database.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Execu