styling of the drawing interface, specifically requesting a color shift to green and white. They also raised concerns regarding UI logic, questioning the necessity of displaying all teams and pointing out data duplication issues in the team list.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Reviewing visual styling and data redundancy in team drawing tool","timestamp":"2026-06-01T15:06:04.089Z","title":"UI/UX Feedback: Drawing Interface Improvements","type":"conversation"},"obs_mpvcd1w7_e8c038eb3ff3":{"concepts":["SQL deduplication","data integrity","PostgreSQL aggregate functions","data cleaning"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Table 'sports_teams' contains duplicates for multiple entries.","15 specific Romanian teams (e.g., FCSB, CFR Cluj, Dinamo Bucuresti) exhibit 4 occurrences per name.","Database query identified distinct IDs for each duplicate entry."],"files":[],"id":"obs_mpvcd1w7_e8c038eb3ff3","importance":6,"narrative":"A query was executed on the 'scoru' database to identify data redundancy for teams located in Romania. The results confirm a systematic duplication issue, with at least 15 major teams appearing exactly 4 times each, necessitating a data deduplication or migration strategy.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Identified 15 Romanian teams with 4 duplicate records each","timestamp":"2026-06-01T15:06:24.315Z","title":"Detected data duplication in sports_teams table","type":"command_run"},"obs_mpvcdp6i_284a26049680":{"concepts":["SQL data integrity","PostgreSQL JSONB querying","data deduplication","ETL verification"],"confidence":1,"facts":["sports_teams table contains 1469 total rows","242 duplicate rows identified based on (name, country) combination","FCSB team maps to canonical livescore ID 4502 in raw_api_data","Raw JSON data for T1 matches contains consistent ID field"],"files":["postgresql://postgres@localhost:5432/scoru"],"id":"obs_mpvcdp6i_284a26049680","importance":5,"narrative":"The investigation revealed significant data redundancy in the sports_teams table, with roughly 16% of rows being duplicates. Simultaneously, the query confirmed that the raw_api_data JSON blob contains reliable canonical identifiers that can be used for deduplication or mapping strategies.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Database investigation of table consistency and raw JSON structure","timestamp":"2026-06-01T15:06:54.492Z","title":"Analyze sports_teams duplicates and fetch canonical ID","type":"command_run"},"obs_mpvcetce_9b5ce8b364e1":{"concepts":["data normalization","database migration","transactional data migration","foreign key management"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Script uses Livescore API IDs (T1/T2[0].ID) as the canonical key for team merging.","Fallback key for non-resolved teams is (lowercase(name), country).","Deduplication strategy: keep the oldest record (smallest created_at) and repoint all foreign keys to it.","Affected tables include: sports_matches, sports_match_lineups, sports_match_events, sports_player_team_seasons.","Includes a dry-run mode and an --apply flag to execute the transaction."],"files":["scripts/maintenance/dedup-teams.ts"],"id":"obs_mpvcetce_9b5ce8b364e1","importance":8,"narrative":"Created a maintenance script to resolve data fragmentation caused by duplicate team entries. The script identifies duplicates by mapping team names to stable Livescore IDs or fallback properties, then performs a transactional update to merge FK references before deleting redundant rows.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Implemented deduplication logic for sports_teams using Livescore IDs","timestamp":"2026-06-01T15:07:46.548Z","title":"Created team deduplication maintenance script","type":"file_write"},"obs_mpvceycg_52d099c1af7b":{"concepts":["data-reconciliation","database-maintenance","typescript-scripting"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Identified 157 duplicate team groups","286 rows targeted for merging","Processing 1469 total team entries","Script output confirms stable resolution to Livescore IDs"],"files":["scripts/maintenance/dedup-teams.ts"],"id":"obs_mpvceycg_52d099c1af7b","importance":5,"narrative":"Ran the deduplication maintenance script in dry-run mode to verify impact. The script successfully identified 286 rows for merging across 157 groups, confirming the data reconciliation logic is sound before applying changes.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Dry-run of scripts/maintenance/dedup-teams.ts","timestamp":"2026-06-01T15:07:53.025Z","title":"Executed team deduplication script","type":"command_run"},"obs_mpvcf46m_a7eabd70d46c":{"concepts":["PostgreSQL","foreign key constraint","data migration","referential integrity"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Script: scripts/maintenance/dedup-teams.ts","Command executed with --apply flag","Database: postgresql://postgres@localhost:5432/scoru","Error: ri_ReportViolation at sports_match_stats_team_id_sports_teams_id_fk"],"files":["scripts/maintenance/dedup-teams.ts"],"id":"obs_mpvcf46m_a7eabd70d46c","importance":7,"narrative":"The team deduplication script failed because it attempted to merge or remove team records that are still referenced by foreign keys in the sports_match_stats table. The database blocked the operation to maintain referential integrity, indicating the cleanup logic needs to account for existing child records.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Execution of dedup-teams.ts failed on foreign key constraint","timestamp":"2026-06-01T15:08:00.595Z","title":"Database integrity violation during team deduplication","type":"command_run"},"obs_mpvcf9fk_0e2508da26d1":{"concepts":["SQL migration","Database maintenance","Foreign Key refactoring","Data deduplication"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Updated dedup-teams.ts transaction logic","Added update query for sports_match_stats table","Ensured FKs from match stats are re-pointed to canonical team record"],"files":["/Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/scripts/maintenance/dedup-teams.ts"],"id":"obs_mpvcf9fk_0e2508da26d1","importance":5,"narrative":"The deduplication script was missing the sports_match_stats table in its migration process. By adding this update query, the script now ensures all statistics associated with duplicate team entries are correctly transferred to the canonical record during the maintenance merge.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Updating cleanup script to include stats table in FK migration","timestamp":"2026-06-01T15:08:07.392Z","title":"Add sports_match_stats to team deduplication script","type":"file_edit"},"obs_mpvcfe5h_8db82bfa9974":{"concepts":["database maintenance","data deduplication","transactional integrity"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Script applied via: npx tsx scripts/maintenance/dedup-teams.ts --apply","286 duplicate team rows were successfully merged","Database current state: 1183 teams remaining","Operation executed within a database transaction"],"files":["scripts/maintenance/dedup-teams.ts"],"id":"obs_mpvcfe5h_8db82bfa9974","importance":5,"narrative":"The team deduplication script was executed against the PostgreSQL database to clean up redundant records. The process successfully merged 286 entries, leaving a total of 1183 teams in the system.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Execution of dedup-teams.ts maintenance script","timestamp":"2026-06-01T15:08:13.515Z","title":"Database Team Data Deduplication","type":"command_run"},"obs_mpvcflo1_8e42e8913750":{"concepts":["SQL deduplication","Data integrity validation","PostgreSQL","TypeScript service layer"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Duplicate team records (name/country collision) successfully eliminated (remaining_dupes = 0)","FCSB team record verified via getTeamFixtures: 115 matches, 195 points, form 'WWLDL'","Verified data consistency after potential merging operations"],"files":["src/lib/server/teams.ts"],"id":"obs_mpvcflo1_8e42e8913