t) now maps to var(--sb-draw)"],"files":["/Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/src/pages/echipe/[slug].astro"],"id":"obs_mpvcgfm1_dfee236b6d1a","importance":4,"narrative":"Updated the formColor helper function in the Astro team page template to use specific semantic CSS variables for Win/Loss/Draw states instead of generic ink/live variables. This improves visual consistency for team performance indicators.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Refining CSS variable assignments in [slug].astro","timestamp":"2026-06-01T15:09:02.061Z","title":"Update form color logic for team fixtures","type":"file_edit"},"obs_mpvch6fl_6eba2fefc985":{"concepts":["SQL CTEs","PostgreSQL aggregation","League standings algorithm","Server-side data fetching"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Implemented getCompetitionsList with SQL aggregation to count teams and matches per competition.","Implemented getCompetitionStandings using a CTE for match results and ranking logic.","Standings ranked by points (3/1/0), goal difference, and goals scored.","getTeamsForSearch provides lightweight team metadata for autocomplete functionality."],"files":["/Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/src/lib/server/teams.ts"],"id":"obs_mpvch6fl_6eba2fefc985","importance":6,"narrative":"Added essential server-side data fetching logic for the sports competition domain. The code uses raw SQL with Drizzle/Postgres to efficiently compute standings and aggregate match data, supporting UI requirements for league tables and team search.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Added database-driven helpers for competition standings and team search","timestamp":"2026-06-01T15:09:36.823Z","title":"Implement league standings and competitions list logic","type":"file_edit"},"obs_mpvchezh_82ba864c03b5":{"concepts":["TypeScript","PostgreSQL","Data access layer","API verification"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Retrieved 20 active competitions from the database","Validated Premier League standings return correct fields: position, name, points, and games played","Confirmed getCompetitionStandings is functional and returns expected structure"],"files":["src/lib/server/teams.ts"],"id":"obs_mpvchezh_82ba864c03b5","importance":4,"narrative":"Executed a script to verify the competition retrieval and standings calculation logic within the server-side modules. The data returned confirms that the queries and aggregation logic correctly handle team counts and standings for league competitions.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Validating getCompetitionsList and getCompetitionStandings logic","timestamp":"2026-06-01T15:09:47.906Z","title":"Verification of competition data access layer","type":"command_run"},"obs_mpvciiwr_fedbf2f0f558":{"concepts":["Astro components","Server-side rendering","CSS variables","Search UI patterns"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Implemented Astro component for /echipe/index.astro","Integrated server-side data fetching for competitions, standings, and team search","Added helper functions for UI (initials, country codes, color hashing)","Included search input and autocomplete UI skeleton","Used CSS custom properties for theme consistency (SB design system)"],"files":["src/pages/echipe/index.astro"],"id":"obs_mpvciiwr_fedbf2f0f558","importance":5,"narrative":"Initialized the team directory page with a competition selection UI and search functionality. The component handles server-side data fetching for competitions and teams while providing a layout for future autocomplete integration.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Setting up competition browsing and team search","timestamp":"2026-06-01T15:10:39.647Z","title":"Initialize Echipe Page structure","type":"file_edit"},"obs_mpvciqt3_f475cbe7b905":{"concepts":["API integration","CSS styling","data filtering","PostgreSQL query"],"confidence":1,"facts":["/echipe endpoint returns 200 OK with relevant league and team names.","/echipe?comp=PL successfully filters for Premier League teams including Arsenal, Liverpool, and Manchester City.","/echipe/fcsb contains expected CSS classes: sb-win, sb-loss, and sb-draw."],"files":["/tmp/e1.html","/tmp/e2.html","/tmp/e3.html"],"id":"obs_mpvciqt3_f475cbe7b905","importance":5,"narrative":"Verified that the new /echipe endpoint serves data correctly and supports competition-based filtering using internal database IDs. Confirmed that team-specific detail pages correctly embed performance-related CSS classes for UI styling.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Validating data retrieval and dynamic class rendering","timestamp":"2026-06-01T15:10:49.884Z","title":"Verification of /echipe endpoints and CSS classes","type":"command_run"},"obs_mpvciyiz_415b3ea4ea24":{"concepts":["log analysis","error handling","debugging"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Executed grep on task log file /private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-torel-code-2025-scoru/348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc/tasks/bttiw4xvr.output","Search pattern includes: error, fail, cannot, warn.*echipe","Command returned empty stdout, indicating no errors found in the last 30 lines"],"files":["/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-torel-code-2025-scoru/348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc/tasks/bttiw4xvr.output"],"id":"obs_mpvciyiz_415b3ea4ea24","importance":3,"narrative":"Performed a diagnostic check on the recent task execution logs to ensure no silent failures occurred. The search returned no matches, suggesting the execution completed without identified errors.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Grepping task logs for failure indicators","timestamp":"2026-06-01T15:10:59.888Z","title":"Final error check on task output","type":"command_run"},"obs_mpvcjfyn_646600a242b4":{"concepts":["UI/UX redesign","Data modeling","League management"],"confidence":0.9,"facts":["Renaming the 'Echipe' (Teams) page to 'Ligi' (Leagues).","New requirements include league standings (points) and match tracking."],"fi