","date manipulation"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Implemented seasonStartFromDate utility to map dates to football seasons (Aug-Jul)","Added seasonPredicate to generate SQL filters for specific season start years","Added getCompetitionSeasons to fetch unique seasons for a competition","Updated getCompetitionStandings to accept an optional seasonStart parameter"],"files":["src/lib/server/teams.ts"],"id":"obs_mpvcrjmp_19035c683544","importance":7,"narrative":"The codebase previously only computed lifetime standings. I introduced date-based season derivation and injected dynamic SQL filters to allow querying competition standings per specific football season.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Added season calculation logic and SQL predicates to teams.ts","timestamp":"2026-06-01T15:17:40.484Z","title":"Implement season filtering for league standings","type":"file_edit"},"obs_mpvcs0xl_423464267681":{"concepts":["data normalization","regex pattern matching","data aggregation","server-side business logic"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Added utility functions to parse and normalize competition names into parent league groups.","Implemented grouping logic based on competition name patterns (e.g., \"Liga 1 - Regular Season\").","Added logic to identify a \"primary\" stage within a group and extract leader information from the latest season.","Added sorting for league groups, prioritizing Romania-based leagues."],"files":["/Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/src/lib/server/teams.ts"],"id":"obs_mpvcs0xl_423464267681","importance":7,"narrative":"The user refactored the server-side team/competition logic to group fragmented competition stages (like \"Regular Season\" and \"Playoffs\") into unified league entities. This enables the /ligi index to display a consistent view of parent leagues, showing the current leader and aggregated stats for each group.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Added leagueParent, stageLabel, and getLeagueGroups functions","timestamp":"2026-06-01T15:18:02.912Z","title":"Implement league grouping logic in teams.ts","type":"file_edit"},"obs_mpvcs5d9_f52b8a0d76ee":{"concepts":["TypeScript function overloading","API filtering","Drizzle ORM"],"confidence":0.9,"facts":["Modified getCompetitionMatches function signature in src/lib/server/teams.ts","Added optional parameter seasonStart (number | null) to support seasonal filtering"],"files":["/Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/src/lib/server/teams.ts"],"id":"obs_mpvcs5d9_f52b8a0d76ee","importance":4,"narrative":"Updated the getCompetitionMatches function signature to include an optional seasonStart parameter. This allows for querying match data constrained by specific competition seasons rather than retrieving all matches for a competition indiscriminately.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Added seasonStart filtering capability to match retrieval","timestamp":"2026-06-01T15:18:08.657Z","title":"Update getCompetitionMatches signature","type":"file_edit"},"obs_mpvcs8f5_aa4752e4af4e":{"concepts":["data aggregation","TypeScript interfaces","server-side data processing"],"confidence":1,"facts":["getLeagueGroups aggregates competitions into parent leagues using a Map keyed by parent name and country.","pickPrimary function selects the league stage with the highest team count.","LeagueGroup interface includes metadata for leader display: leaderName, leaderLogo, and leaderPoints.","Reading lines 280-320 of src/lib/server/teams.ts."],"files":["src/lib/server/teams.ts"],"id":"obs_mpvcs8f5_aa4752e4af4e","importance":3,"narrative":"The agent inspected the server-side logic for grouping sports competitions. The code uses a Map to consolidate stages into parent league groups and contains a helper function to determine the primary stage for display purposes.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Inspecting getLeagueGroups implementation and primary stage selection","timestamp":"2026-06-01T15: