,"Dynamic UI rendering"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Renamed c.teamCount to c.totalTeams","Renamed c.playedCount to c.totalPlayed","Added conditional display for c.stages (if length > 1)","Added conditional display for c.latestSeason using seasonLabel helper","Updated CSS class to include flex-wrap for better responsiveness"],"files":["/Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/src/pages/ligi/index.astro"],"id":"obs_mpvctjme_4498ae1133c1","importance":4,"narrative":"Refactored the competition card component in the league index page to display richer metadata. The update now includes the number of stages and the latest active season, while also improving the card layout via flex-wrap for better handling of content overflow.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Refactoring league component card display in index.astro","timestamp":"2026-06-01T15:19:13.787Z","title":"Update league cards with extended metadata","type":"file_edit"},"obs_mpvcunlb_b959dbd48ed3":{"concepts":["Astro SSR","Dynamic Routing","URLSearchParams","Server-side Data Fetching"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Implemented dynamic routing for league pages using slug parameters","Added URL-based state management for stage and season selection","Integrated server-side data fetching for competition standings and matches","Created utility functions for country code mapping and display formatting","Implemented a responsive layout using Astro and custom CSS variables"],"files":["src/pages/ligi/[slug].astro"],"id":"obs_mpvcunlb_b959dbd48ed3","importance":5,"narrative":"The league detail page was structured to support multi-stage and multi-season viewing. It uses URL query parameters to maintain context, allowing users to toggle between different league stages and historical seasons while preserving their view.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Implemented league page with stage and season navigation","timestamp":"2026-06-01T15:20:05.588Z","title":"Update league detail page implementation","type":"file_edit"},"obs_mpvcuvbx_6838fedb250b":{"concepts":["web scraping","API verification","endpoint testing","data extraction"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Root /ligi endpoint returns 200 and includes season years 2024-2025 and 2025-2026.","/ligi/liga-1-romania returns 200 and exposes stages: Regular Season, Playoff, Playout, General, Clasament.","/ligi/premier-league returns 200 and confirms presence of Arsenal and season years."],"files":["/tmp/l1.html","/tmp/l2.html","/tmp/l3.html"],"id":"obs_mpvcuvbx_6838fedb250b","importance":4,"narrative":"Performed a series of curl requests to validate the content rendering and data availability of league-specific pages. The verification confirms that seasonal tabs and specific match phases are correctly accessible via the local web server.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Checking response content for league pages and seasons","timestamp":"2026-06-01T15:20:15.618Z","title":"Verification of /ligi endpoint structure","type":"command_run"},"obs_mpvcvd7o_d286a66bb127":{"concepts":["heuristic prioritization","data selection logic","sports data modeling"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Modified pickPrimary function to prioritize \"Regular Season\" labels.","Fallback remains the stage with the highest team count if no \"Regular Season\" stage is found.","Uses case-insensitive regex for stage label matching."],"files":["src/lib/server/teams.ts"],"id":"obs_mpvcvd7o_d286a66bb127","importance":4,"narrative":"The previous implementation of pickPrimary relied solely on the team count, which caused issues in competitions like the Champions League where knockout stages might have different team counts than the general league phase. This update explicitly prefers \"Regular Season\" stages to ensure accurate league table representation.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Refining team leaderboard stage detection in teams.ts","timestamp":"2026-06-01T15:20:38.794Z","title":"Update primary league stage selection logic","type":"file_edit"},"obs_mpvcvkdp_398f7ff503f3":{"concepts":["API health check","PostgreSQL integration","Data validation"],"confidence":1,"facts":["API endpoint /ligi/liga-1-romania returned HTTP 200","League data retrieved via getLeagueGroupBySlug('liga-1-romania')","Primary stage identified as \"Regular Season\" for 2025 season","Current league leader is CS Universitatea Craiova with 60 points","No recent critical errors found in task output log"],"files":["src/lib/server/teams.ts"],"id":"obs_mpvcvkdp_398f7ff503f3","importance":4,"narrative":"Performed an integration check on the league data pipeline to ensure the primary stage label and leader data match expected values. The command verified that the database connection is operational and retrieved the correct metadata for the 2025 season of Liga 1 Romania without encountering reported errors.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Checked liga-1-romania API status and server data integrity","timestamp":"2026-06-01T15:20:48.083Z","title":"Verification of League Data and Error Logs","type":"command_run"},"obs_mpvcxbdf_37794fb4ce16":{"concepts":["business logic","data transformation","league standings algorithm"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Regular season points must be halved before playoff/playout stage.","Playoff/playout points are added to the halved regular season total.","Current implementation is mathematically incorrect based on user feedback."],"files":["src/logic/standings.js"],"id":"obs_mpvcxbdf_37794fb4ce16","importance":7,"narrative":"The user identified a critical logic error in the point calculation system for the league's playoff and playout stages. The current system fails to account for the mandatory halving of regular season points prior to adding performance points from the secondary stages.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Refining playoff/playout point accumulation rules","timestamp":"2026-06-01T15:22:09.702Z","title":"Correction of League Point Calculation Logic","type":"conversation"},"obs_mpvcygt0_105ca0dc0895":{"concepts":["data normalization","data filtering","business logic refinement"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Implemented conditional removal of \"General\" stage labels in team aggregation logic.","Added filter logic triggered when \"Regular Season\" stage label is present.","Addresses data redundancy issue where specific leagues (e.g., Romania) duplicated match fixtures under different labels."],"files":["/Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/src/lib/server/teams.ts"],"id":"obs_mpvcygt0_105ca0dc0895","importance":4,"narrative":"The data processing layer for the teams directory was showing duplicate fixtures due to overlapping stage labels in the raw match data. I added a filter to prioritize \"Regular Season\" labels and drop the redundant \"General\" label to clean up the UI display.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Fixing duplicate fixtures display in team directory","timestamp":"2026-06-01T15:23:03.417Z","title":"Add stage filtering for redundant \"General\" labels","type":"file_edit"},"obs_mpvcym8v_1d3f684ed1eb":{"concepts":["TypeScript interface","Sports data modeling","League standings logic"],"confidence":0.9,"facts":["Added optional field 'startPoints' to the 'StandingRow' TypeScript interface.","Provided JSDoc comment clarifying 'startPoints' represents points carried into playoff/playout phases from halved regular-season totals."],"files":["/Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/src/lib/server/teams.ts"],"id":"obs_mpvcym8v_1d3f684ed1eb","importance":5,"narrative":"The 'StandingRow' interface was updated to include 'startPoints', enabling support for competition formats where regular-season points are carried over into secondary phases. This change is necessary to correctly calculate standings in league formats that use points-splitting or carry-over rules.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Adding startPoints property to StandingRow in teams.ts","timestamp":"2026-06-01T15:23:10.467Z","title":"Update StandingRow interface to support playoff/playout start points","type":"file_edit"},"obs_mpvcyua0_5c68f3781071":{"concepts":["business logic implementation","data aggregation","sorting algorithms"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Implemented cumulative points logic: total = ceil(regularSeasonPoints / 2) + phasePoints","Added getPlayoffStandings function requiring phase and regular season stage IDs","Sort order prioritizes total points, then goal difference, then goals for"],"files":["/Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/src/lib/server/teams.ts"],"id":"obs_mpvcyua0_5c68f3781071","importance":6,"narrative":"Implemented the logic required to calculate playoff standings where teams carry over half their regular season points. This function fetches data for both stages and merges them, ensuring the ranking logic accounts for the cumulative points properly.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Added getPlayoffStandings function to teams.ts","timestamp":"2026-06-01T15:23:20.877Z","title":"Implement Romanian-style playoff/playout logic","type":"file_edit"},"obs_mpvcz2nw_b96ddacf2218":{"concepts":["Astro framework","Data fetching","Server-side rendering"],"confidence":0.9,"facts":["Updated import block in /src/pages/ligi/[slug].astro","Added getPlayoffStandings to the named imports from ../../lib/server/teams"],"files":["/Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/src/pages/ligi/[slug].astro"],"id":"obs_mpvcz2nw_b96ddacf2218","importance":4,"narrative":"The import statement was modified to include getPlayoffStandings from the server utility module. This change prepares the component to fetch and display playoff-specific data alongside regular competition standings.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Adding playoff standings capability to league detail page","timestamp":"2026-06-01T15:23:31.746Z","title":"Import getPlayoffStandings in [slug].astro","type":"file_edit"},"obs_mpvcz7n5_86c3f897bd36":{"concepts":["Astro framework","Data orchestration","Conditional data fetching","Regex-based routing logic"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Added check for playoff/playout stage labels to identify post-regular season phases","Implemented conditional logic to use getPlayoffStandings when in a playoff phase with a regular season reference","Added calculation for hasCarryover to detect startPoints in standings data"],"files":["/Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/src/pages/ligi/[slug].astro"],"id":"obs_mpvcz7n5_86c3f897bd36","importance":6,"narrative":"Modified the Astro page data fetching logic to correctly handle league formats where regular season points are carried over into playoffs. This ensures that playoff standings accurately reflect halved points from the regular season for specific league formats like the Romanian championship.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Update standings retrieval in [slug].astro","timestamp":"2026-06-01T15:23:38.195Z","title":"Implement Romanian-style playoff/playout carryover logic","type":"file_edit"},"obs_mpvczdty_9a43b314ea82":{"concepts":["Astro framework","Frontmatter syntax","Code cleanup"],"confidence":0.9,"facts":["The file /Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/src/pages/ligi/[slug].astro contained redundant --- separators.","Replaced the duplicated block \"const hasCarryover = ...\\n---\\n---\" with the correct single statement."],"files":["/Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/src/pages/ligi/[slug].astro"],"id":"obs_mpvczdty_9a43b314ea82","importance":4,"narrative":"The file contained a syntax error caused by double YAML frontmatter separators, which interrupted the Astro component code block. I removed the redundant separators to ensure the component compiles correctly.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Clean up redundant YAML separators","timestamp":"2026-06-01T15:23:46.191Z","title":"Remove duplicate frontmatter separators in [slug].astro","type":"file_edit"},"obs_mpvczqj5_e37f64eec7ab":{"concepts":["Astro UI components","Conditional rendering","CSS clamp font scaling","Sports data logic"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Added a conditional disclaimer for leagues with carryover points","Modified h2 margin from mb-4 to mb-2 for tighter spacing","Used the 'hasCarryover' boolean to toggle the new UI element","New notice uses font-mono-num and custom CSS variables for styling"],"files":["/Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/src/pages/ligi/[slug].astro"],"id":"obs_mpvczqj5_e37f64eec7ab","importance":5,"narrative":"I injected a UI notification into the league standings page that explicitly informs users when regular season points are halved in a playoff phase. This provides necessary context for the complex scoring rules used in certain competition formats, improving transparency for the user.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Updating [slug].astro UI for league playoff phases","timestamp":"2026-06-01T15:24:02.676Z","title":"Add carryover points notice to standings page","type":"file_edit"},"obs_mpvczxnq_892a4fe82e18":{"concepts":["Astro UI components","Data visualization","Playoff standings","Tabular data rendering"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Modified standings display in /src/pages/ligi/[slug].astro","Introduced a secondary line below points to show t.startPoints when available","Added visual indicator '↳' with a tooltip for carryover points","Maintained font-mono-num and tabular-nums for alignment"],"files":["/Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/src/pages/ligi/[slug].astro"],"id":"obs_mpvczxnq_892a4fe82e18","importance":4,"narrative":"Updated the standings UI component in the league page to explicitly show startPoints (carryover points from regular season) underneath the current total points. This provides users with better context regarding the current playoff/playout rankings, specifically for formats where regular season points are halved and carried forward.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Updated [slug].astro to display startPoints","timestamp":"2026-06-01T15:24:11.915Z","title":"Add carryover points visualization to standings table","type":"file_edit"},"obs_mpvd04z1_e3f73735b27d":{"concepts":["TypeScript","PostgreSQL","Data validation","League standings logic"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Regular season points are successfully carrying over to playoff stages","CS Universitatea Craiova leads with 50 total points (30 carryover + 20 playoff)","The data retrieval correctly distinguishes between 'Regular Season', 'Playoff', and 'Playout' stages","Total points formula verified: (points - startPoints) equals playoff stage performance"],"files":["src/lib/server/teams.ts"],"id":"obs_mpvd04z1_e3f73735b27d","importance":5,"narrative":"Executed a script to verify that playoff standings correctly aggregate regular season carryover points. The output confirms that the points calculation logic correctly maps `startPoints` (regular season) and adds phase-specific points to determine the final standings.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Debugging league standings calculation for Liga 1 Romania","timestamp":"2026-06-01T15:24:21.392Z","title":"Verification of playoff point carryover logic","type":"command_run"},"obs_mpvd0ffp_0a6886cea533":{"concepts":["HTML scraping","Dynamic UI rendering","Regression testing","Integration verification"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Playoff stage ID identified as comp_1748080154072_vgia1c5d5 for liga-1-romania","Playoff page renders successfully (HTTP 200)","Playoff page content contains expected identifiers: Craiova, Regular Season, ÎNJUMĂTĂȚESC, ↳30","Default league page (no stage param) does not contain GENERAL tab"],"files":["src/lib/server/teams.ts"],"id":"obs_mpvd0ffp_0a6886cea533","importance":5,"narrative":"Performed a diagnostic check to ensure the league playoff page loads correctly and verify that the 'General' tab is excluded from the default view. Verified the logic by fetching the dynamic playoff stage ID using the internal teams module and comparing the HTML output of the default vs playoff routes.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Validating stage-specific league navigation","timestamp":"2026-06-01T15:24:34.953Z","title":"Verify Playoff Page Rendering and Tabs","type":"command_run"},"obs_mpvd0ngy_ce5d55b916f6":{"concepts":["HTML scraping","Log analysis","UI verification"],"confidence":0.9,"facts":["No expected tab markers (General, Playoff, Playout, Regular Season) found in /tmp/def.html","No error strings detected in the last 20 lines of the task output file"],"files":["/tmp/def.html","/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-torel-code-2025-scoru/348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc/tasks/bttiw4xvr.output"],"id":"obs_mpvd0ngy_ce5d55b916f6","importance":4,"narrative":"The agent inspected the default HTML page to verify the presence of specific navigation tabs and checked the recent task logs for runtime errors. Neither the expected UI elements nor any error indicators were present in the output.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Checking UI structure and checking for runtime failures","timestamp":"2026-06-01T15:24:45.360Z","title":"Verification of default page tabs and error log","type":"command_run"},"obs_mpvd0r3j_24164338e658":{"concepts":["data extraction","grep","regex"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Found 1 instance of 'Playoff'","Found 1 instance of 'Playout'","Found 1 instance of 'Regular Season'","'General' label was not found in the file"],"files":["/tmp/def.html"],"id":"obs_mpvd0r3j_24164338e658","importance":3,"narrative":"Performed a grep search on /tmp/def.html to identify and quantify the different stage labels present in the document. This data confirms the structure of the league stage hierarchy within the source file.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Verifying presence of season stages via grep","timestamp":"2026-06-01T15:24:50.070Z","title":"Count stage labels in /tmp/def.html","type":"command_run"},"obs_mpvd5k5e_9159351c63be":{"concepts":["Tournament Structure","Date-based Filtering","Conditional UI Rendering","Elimination Bracket Logic"],"confidence":1,"facts":["European competitions (Champions League, Europa League, Conference League) require moving from group stage to elimination phase logic.","Default view for competitions must automatically select the current phase based on date.","Romanian league requirements: consolidate Playoff and Playout into one view.","Requirement to display promotion/relegation and qualification playoff matches separately."],"files":["src/components/competitions/LeagueView.tsx","src/utils/competitionPhases.ts"],"id":"obs_mpvd5k5e_9159351c63be","importance":8,"narrative":"The user identified a need to transition the UI/logic for European competitions from group-stage formats to elimination brackets. Additionally, the Romanian league structure needs to be flattened to show Playoff and Playout simultaneously, with specific handling for post-season relegation and European qualification matches.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Transitioning from group-based to elimination phases and handling complex league structures","timestamp":"2026-06-01T15:28:34.322Z","title":"Refactor Competition Phase Logic for European and Romanian Leagues","type":"task"},"obs_mpvd5w0m_023124084302":{"concepts":["SQL aggregation","PostgreSQL","Data profiling"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Queried 9 distinct European competitions from the 'scoru' database.","Aggregated match counts, date ranges, and status distribution (finished vs scheduled).","Data confirms active matches exist across all 9 competition categories."],"files":[],"id":"obs_mpvd5w0m_023124084302","importance":4,"narrative":"Ran a SQL aggregation query on the 'sports_matches' and 'sports_competitions' tables to verify the distribution of matches for European competitions. The results provide an overview of match volume and completion status for Champions, Europa, and Conference leagues including qualification stages.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Postgres analysis of match distribution by competition","timestamp":"2026-06-01T15:28:49.723Z","title":"Query Europe competition match statistics","type":"command_run"},"obs_mpvd621a_152f80ce1ac8":{"concepts":["SQL query analysis","schema inspection","data normalization"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Querying Champions League Knockout matches via sports_competitions.name","Database scan reveals 45 matches across the knockout stage","The 'round' column in sports_matches is currently empty (null) for these records","Sample data shows matches are logged as individual event dates without explicit 'Leg 1' or 'Leg 2' identifiers in the round column"],"files":["sports_matches","sports_competitions","sports_teams"],"id":"obs_mpvd621a_152f80ce1ac8","importance":5,"narrative":"I queried the database to determine if the knockout rounds were structured or identifiable by round/leg. The results indicate that while the competition matches exist, the 'round' column is null, meaning current schema logic does not differentiate between legs or specific knockout stages automatically.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Verifying presence of leg/round indicators in sports_matches","timestamp":"2026-06-01T15:28:57.526Z","title":"Analyze Champions League knockout round data structure","type":"command_run"},"obs_mpvd6fdz_3152f83a298c":{"concepts":["PostgreSQL","jsonb","data exploration"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Retrieved JSON structure for match 'Brest' in 'Champions League Knockout'","Raw API data uses nested arrays for teams (T1, T2)","Identifiers extracted: Brest ID '3498', PSG ID '3910'"],"files":["import_raw_data"],"id":"obs_mpvd6fdz_3152f83a298c","importance":4,"narrative":"The agent queried the PostgreSQL database to inspect the structure of raw match data for a specific Champions League fixture. This inspection confirmed the nesting format of team objects within the 'matches' JSON array, which is necessary for parsing future match records.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Querying raw JSON match data for Brest vs PSG","timestamp":"2026-06-01T15:29:14.825Z","title":"Inspect Champions League Knockout match data","type":"command_run"},"obs_mpvd6nb7_145438a169fc":{"concepts":["PostgreSQL JSONB","API data inspection","Error handling"],"confidence":1,"facts":["SQL query failed to extract keys from match->'raw_api_data' for Brest matches","Live API stage endpoint returned 1 stage (Sid 24464) for Champions League Knockout","Live API stage events list is empty, causing index out of range error in debug script"],"files":["import_raw_data"],"id":"obs_mpvd6nb7_145438a169fc","importance":4,"narrative":"Attempted to correlate internal SQL data with live API structure to identify round metadata keys. The SQL lookup for specific match keys returned no rows, and the API diagnostic script failed due to an empty event list for the queried stage.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Debugging 'Brest' match data for Champions League Knockout","timestamp":"2026-06-01T15:29:25.093Z","title":"Inspect round metadata in SQL storage and Live API","type":"command_run"},"obs_mpvd7b8x_11e6b79e8a9d":{"concepts":["SQL","PostgreSQL","data-analysis","schema-exploration"],"confidence":1,"facts":["No competitions found with 'baraj', 'relegation', 'promotion', 'barrage', or 'relegare' in name.","Champions League Knockout has 5 scheduled matches starting 2025-02-19.","Conference League Knockout has 3 scheduled matches starting 2025-02-20.","Europa League Knockout has 8 scheduled matches starting 2025-02-20."],"files":["postgresql://postgres@localhost:5432/scoru"],"id":"obs_mpvd7b8x_11e6b79e8a9d","importance":4,"narrative":"Executed SQL queries to identify promotional/relegation play-off competitions and determine the schedule for upcoming knockout stage matches. The results indicate no specific 'baraj' related competitions exist, while three main European knockout competitions have active scheduled matches.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Inspected 'baraj' keywords and 'scheduled' knockout matches","timestamp":"2026-06-01T15:29:56.120Z","title":"Database query for competition status and scheduling","type":"command_run"},"obs_mpvdb2vw_b7e547e7e50c":{"concepts":["Responsive Design","API Data Normalization","UX Strategy","State Management"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Knockout stages will use a hybrid UI: list-based on mobile, bracket-based on desktop.","Default stage selection will dynamically default to the most recent active phase.","Investigation planned to verify if Livescore API provides data for Romanian league promotion/relegation playoffs."],"files":[],"id":"obs_mpvdb2vw_b7e547e7e50c","importance":7,"narrative":"Defined implementation strategy for knockout phases and navigation defaults to improve user experience. Proceeding with investigation of Livescore data endpoints for specific Romanian league events to decide on inclusion scope.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Product requirements clarified for Livescore integration","timestamp":"2026-06-01T15:32:51.886Z","title":"UI/UX Design decisions for Knockout stages and data defaults","type":"decision"},"obs_mpvdbgxb_0e31c114e344":{"concepts":["API exploration","data extraction","JSON parsing","shell scripting"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Targeted API endpoint: prod-cdn-public-api.livescore.com/v1/api/app/date/soccer/","Dates queried: 20250522, 20250525, 20250529, 20260521, 20260525","Data found for 20260525: romania/liga-1-championship-group (1 match)","No relevant events found for other specified dates"],"files":[],"id":"obs_mpvdbgxb_0e31c114e344","importance":4,"narrative":"Performed a series of HTTP requests using curl to probe the LiveScore API for specific Romanian soccer stages across multiple historical and recent dates. Parsed the resulting JSON output via Python to identify events associated with 'romania', successfully locating a match in the 'liga-1-championship-group' on 2026-05-25.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Probing specific dates for Romanian soccer match events","timestamp":"2026-06-01T15:33:10.101Z","title":"Query LiveScore API for Romanian stage data","type":"command_run"},"obs_mpvdbq6o_9ceb43017e6f":{"concepts":["API scraping","JSON parsing","cURL","data extraction"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Target URL: prod-cdn-public-api.livescore.com/v1/api/app/date/soccer/{DATE}/0","Filtering criteria: Ccd == 'romania'","Targeted output: Date, Scd (slug), and event count per stage","Headers include User-Agent, Accept, Origin, and Referer"],"files":[],"id":"obs_mpvdbq6o_9ceb43017e6f","importance":4,"narrative":"The agent queried the LiveScore public API across a specific date range in May and June 2025 to identify active Romania soccer stages. The script parsed JSON responses to extract stage slugs (Scd) and event counts, identifying relevant data for sports data mapping.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Iterating over date range 2025-05-15 to 2025-06-04","timestamp":"2026-06-01T15:33:22.102Z","title":"Fetch Romania soccer stage slugs from LiveScore API","type":"command_run"},"obs_mpvdbz5e_106db1e405da":{"concepts":["API discovery","HTTP 410 Gone","Data scraping"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Probed 7 distinct URL paths under /soccer/romania/ using the LiveScore API v1","All endpoints returned HTTP 410 (Gone), indicating these specific paths are invalid or decommissioned","Used curl with browser-like headers to simulate valid client requests"],"files":[],"id":"obs_mpvdbz5e_106db1e405da","importance":4,"narrative":"The agent attempted to discover valid API paths for Romanian soccer stages by iterating through common URL patterns. All tested endpoints consistently returned 410, confirming that these specific paths do not exist in the current API schema.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Verifying endpoint accessibility for soccer stage data","timestamp":"2026-06-01T15:33:33.720Z","title":"Probe LiveScore API for Romania Play-off paths","type":"command_run"},"obs_mpvddpt9_a66940a2c6a4":{"concepts":["data clustering","tournament bracket logic","Drizzle ORM","heuristic inference"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Added stageKind() helper to classify stages as standings, knockout, or playoff.","Implemented getKnockoutBracket() to cluster matches into tournament rounds via date-gap heuristics (14-day threshold).","Defined TypeScript interfaces KnockoutLeg, KnockoutTie, and KnockoutRound for structured bracket data.","Implemented automatic tie aggregation (aggregate scores) for multi-leg knockout matches."],"files":["/Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/src/lib/server/teams.ts"],"id":"obs_mpvddpt9_a66940a2c6a4","importance":7,"narrative":"The codebase now supports inferred bracket construction for knockout stages where explicit round metadata is missing. The implementation clusters matches by time gaps and groups them into ties based on team pairings, enabling dynamic UI generation for tournament views.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Added utilities for parsing knockout stages and bracket generation","timestamp":"2026-06-01T15:34:54.930Z","title":"Implement knockout bracket logic and stage classification","type":"file_edit"},"obs_mpvddy1p_3e58b2772909":{"concepts":["TypeScript runtime execution","Knockout tournament bracket","Data normalization","PostgreSQL integration"],"confidence":1,"facts":["League group 'champions-league' contains stages: General, Knockout, Qualification","Knockout stage for season 2024 returns 2 rounds: 'Play-off' and 'Runda · 6 tâlcări'","Play-off round successfully retrieves 16 ties with correct aggregate scores and winners"],"files":["src/lib/server/teams.ts"],"id":"obs_mpvddy1p_3e58b2772909","importance":5,"narrative":"Executed a diagnostic script to validate the bracket extraction logic for the 'champions-league' group. The tool confirms that the bracket fetching mechanism correctly maps stage labels and retrieves tie data for knockout rounds, though it identified an unexpected label 'Runda · 6 tâlcări' that may need normalization.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Testing getKnockoutBracket implementation for Champions League","timestamp":"2026-06-01T15:35:05.603Z","title":"Verify knockout bracket inference logic","type":"command_run"},"obs_mpvdfjlm_1fc86b6c3c08":{"concepts":["data transformation","knockout tournament logic","array clustering","UCL format compatibility"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Changed grouping order: now pairs matches into ties first, then clusters ties into rounds.","Increased date gap threshold for round clustering from 14 to 16 days.","Added logic to label consecutive rounds with same-sized ties as \"Play-off\".","Ensured ties are sorted by date before clustering."],"files":["src/lib/server/teams.ts"],"id":"obs_mpvdfjlm_1fc86b6c3c08","importance":7,"narrative":"The tournament bracket generation was refactored to better handle modern knockout formats like the new UCL. By grouping matches into complete ties before clustering them into rounds, the logic is more robust. Additionally, a new conditional label check correctly identifies 'Play-off' rounds when round sizes remain constant.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Change aggregation sequence and round clustering","timestamp":"2026-06-01T15:36:20.187Z","title":"Refactor knockout round logic for new UCL format","type":"file_edit"},"obs_mpvdfqck_4ac50e63eb19":{"concepts":["TypeScript runtime execution","Bracket data normalization","Database schema validation"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Retrieved 4 knockout rounds: Play-off, Optimi, Sferturi, Semifinale","Confirmed data model mapping for teams, tie scores, and leg counts","Identified 'egal' state handling in semifinal tie between Barcelona and Inter"],"files":["src/lib/server/teams.ts"],"id":"obs_mpvdfqck_4ac50e63eb19","importance":5,"narrative":"Ran a diagnostic script to verify the logic for fetching and parsing knockout bracket data from the teams service. The output confirms successful identification of rounds and correct handling of match outcomes, although it highlights a draw scenario (\"egal\") in the semifinals that needs application-level resolution.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Execution of league bracket retrieval for Champions League 2024","timestamp":"2026-06-01T15:36:28.937Z","title":"Verify knockout bracket data inference","type":"command_run"},"obs_mpvdhflr_5c6e1327af32":{"concepts":["Astro server-side rendering","Dynamic UI routing","Data orchestration"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Implemented a Tab system to group competition stages: 'standings', 'knockout', and 'playoff-combo'.","Added logic to merge playoff and playout stages into a single UI tab.","Used SSR-based season selection and automatic tab selection based on the current date/active stage.","Integrated helper functions to fetch competition data conditionally based on tab type."],"files":["src/pages/ligi/[slug].astro"],"id":"obs_mpvdhflr_5c6e1327af32","importance":6,"narrative":"The league page was updated to dynamically generate UI tabs based on competition stages. This logic folds playoff and playout stages into a combined view and selects the active tab based on the current season and stage, improving navigation for complex league formats.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Updating [slug].astro to handle standings, knockout, and playoff/playout tabs","timestamp":"2026-06-01T15:37:48.321Z","title":"Implement dynamic tab logic for league groups","type":"file_edit"},"obs_mpvdhjbh_02e2ecd05a45":{"concepts":["directory structure","project scaffolding"],"confidence":0.9,"facts":["