 normalization","robust error handling","regex pattern matching","API integration"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Replaced switch statement with regex-based normalization and array-based lookups.","Added support for additional status codes: AET, AP, PEN, AWD, FRO, CANCELLED, ABD, POSTPONED, SUSP, BREAK, PENLIVE.","Added numeric minute support for \"live\" status identification via regex.","Sanitizes input by removing non-alphanumeric characters and forcing uppercase."],"files":["src/pages/api/data-pipeline/pull-raw.ts"],"id":"obs_mpvdybeq_8118dbeeff03","importance":5,"narrative":"The status mapping function was updated to handle a significantly wider variety of match status indicators from the Livescore API. By using regex sanitization and lookup arrays instead of a strict switch-case, the function is now more resilient to minor variations in API strings and supports broader live-match tracking.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Updating status categorization logic in data pipeline","timestamp":"2026-06-01T15:50:56.032Z","title":"Refactor mapEventStatus for robust status mapping","type":"file_edit"},"obs_mpvdz0n3_7f3592e24452":{"concepts":["data-pipeline","TypeScript execution","PostgreSQL integration","bracket logic"],"confidence":1,"facts":["API endpoint /api/data-pipeline/run returned success: True","2025-26 Champions League final confirmed as PSG vs Arsenal","Semifinal results: PSG defeated Bayern (6-5 agg), Arsenal defeated Atletico Madrid (2-1 agg)","Final match score is tied 1-1, awaiting penalty/draw resolution"],"files":["src/lib/server/teams.ts"],"id":"obs_mpvdz0n3_7f3592e24452","importance":4,"narrative":"The data pipeline was triggered to ensure current league data availability, followed by a direct TSX execution to query the knockout bracket logic. The script successfully retrieved and displayed the 2025-26 bracket progression, confirming the final matchup between PSG and Arsenal.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Pipeline execution and bracket result validation","timestamp":"2026-06-01T15:51:28.739Z","title":"Verification of 2025-26 Knockout Bracket","type":"command_run"},"obs_mpvdzj93_daae7726c77b":{"concepts":["data validation","API testing","database querying","bracket logic"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Champions League endpoint (/ligi/champions-league) returned HTTP 200.","Content verification confirms presence of knockout stages (Tablou eliminator, Finală, Semifinale, Sferturi) for seasons 2024-2025.","Europa League and Conference League 2025-26 knockout brackets successfully queried using getKnockoutBracket.","Both Europa and Conference Leagues share a uniform structure: Play-off(8), Optimi(8), Sferturi(4), Semifinale(2), Finală(1)."],"files":["src/lib/server/teams.ts"],"id":"obs_mpvdzj93_daae7726c77b","importance":4,"narrative":"Performed a verification of the scoring application's league data structures. Confirmed that the API returns correct season content and that the backend utility correctly retrieves and parses the 2025-26 knockout bracket stages for secondary European competitions.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Validation of season data and bracket stages via API and internal modules","timestamp":"2026-06-01T15:51:52.857Z","title":"Verify Champions League and Europa/Conference League knockout structures","type":"command_run"},"obs_mpvdzrc0_eeabfbaa8149":{"concepts":["smoke testing","HTTP routing","system health check"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Verified 11 application routes via curl","All endpoints returned HTTP 200 status code","Zero recent errors found in /tmp/scoru-dev.log"],"files":["/tmp/scoru-dev.log"],"id":"obs_mpvdzrc0_eeabfbaa8149","importance":4,"narrative":"Performed a systematic health check of all defined application routes to ensure accessibility following recent changes. The absence of logged errors and successful status codes confirms the stability of the routing configuration.","sessionId":"348be0