eague dataset.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Inspection of PostgreSQL jsonb structure for match data","timestamp":"2026-06-01T15:54:00.589Z","title":"Querying raw_api_data for penalty fields in Champions League matches","type":"command_run"},"obs_mpve2qd8_f8e07e0ddffd":{"concepts":["SQL schema migration","PostgreSQL","Database schema evolution"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Added home_penalties (integer) column to sports_matches table","Added away_penalties (integer) column to sports_matches table","Used IF NOT EXISTS clause for schema safety","Database target: postgresql://localhost:5432/scoru"],"files":["N/A"],"id":"obs_mpve2qd8_f8e07e0ddffd","importance":6,"narrative":"Executed a SQL migration to extend the sports_matches schema to support penalty shootout data. This enables the storage of penalty scores for match reporting.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Schema migration for penalty shootout tracking","timestamp":"2026-06-01T15:54:22.050Z","title":"Add penalty columns to sports_matches table","type":"command_run"},"obs_mpve2wb5_4d7bb82c0af9":{"concepts":["Drizzle ORM","PostgreSQL schema","Database migration"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Modified /Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/src/db/schema/sports.ts","Added homePenalties (integer) column","Added awayPenalties (integer) column","Fields are intended to capture knockout stage shootout results"],"files":["/Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/src/db/schema/sports.ts"],"id":"obs_mpve2wb5_4d7bb82c0af9","importance":5,"narrative":"I updated the database schema to support recording penalty shootout results for matches. These fields are necessary to handle knockout ties that are decided beyond the standard scoreline.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Added homePenalties and awayPenalties to match schema","timestamp":"2026-06-01T15:54:29.750Z","title":"Update sports schema with penalty shootout fields","type":"file_edit"},"obs_mpve31j7_c794b1c56991":{"concepts":["data-pipeline","schema-mapping","API-integration","data-normalization"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Modified /src/pages/api/data-pipeline/pull-raw.ts","Added homePenalties and awayPenalties extraction from Trp1 and Trp2 fields","Scores are conditionally parsed when status indicates penalty shootout (Eps: \"AP\")"],"files":["/Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/src/pages/api/data-pipeline/pull-raw.ts"],"id":"obs_mpve31j7_c794b1c56991","importance":4,"narrative":"Updated the data pipeline to correctly capture penalty shootout scores by mapping Trp1 and Trp2 API fields to the internal schema. This change ensures that matches decided by penalties have accurate outcome data beyond regular time scores.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Added penalty scoring fields to match parser","timestamp":"2026-06-01T15:54:36.521Z","title":"Update raw data extraction logic for penalty shootout scores","type":"file_edit"},"obs_mpve350d_f423d7a92ed1":{"concepts":["Drizzle ORM","Database schema mapping","Data normalization"],"confidence":1,"facts":["The code uses db.insert(sportsMatches) to persist match data.","Fields include matchId, slug, eventDate, team IDs, competitionId, and score metadata.","Logic handles match status, live updates, and seasonal defaults (2024-25)."],"files":["src/pages/api/data-assignment/assign-matches.ts"],"id":"obs_mpve350d_f423d7a92ed1","importance":3,"narrative":"Read lines 690-710 of the assignment API endpoint to understand the Drizzle ORM schema mapping for new match entries. This context is required to debug or extend how incoming match data is normalized into the database.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Examining Drizzle ORM insert values for sportsMatches","timestamp":"2026-06-01T15:54:41.029Z","title":"Read match insertion logic in assign-matches.ts","type":"file_read"},"obs_mpve392o_2dbb41fe55df":{"concepts":["data migration","API endpoint","null coalescing","TypeScript interfaces"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Modified /src/pages/api/data-assignment/assign-matches.ts","Added fields homePenalties and awayPenalties to the match object mapping","Used null coalescing operator (??) to default penalty fields to null"],"files":["/Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/src/pages/api/data-assignment/assign-matches.ts"],"id":"obs_mpve392o_2dbb41fe55df","importance":4,"narrative":"The match assignment logic was updated to account for penalty shootouts. By adding these fields to the API endpoint, the system can now correctly persist penalty scores during the raw data import process.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Added homePenalties and awayPenalties to match data processing","timestamp":"2026-06-01T15:54:46.295Z","title":"Update match assignment schema to support penalty scores","type":"file_edit"},"obs_mpve3eg7_fd3ffe48886b":{"concepts":["API data transformation","Drizzle ORM","data synchronization"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Modified /src/pages/api/data-assignment/assign-matches.ts","Added update logic for homePenalties and awayPenalties","Used loose null check (non-strict) to ensure penalty values are applied if present in incoming data"],"files":["/Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/src/pages/api/data-assignment/assign-matches.ts"],"id":"obs_mpve3eg7_fd3ffe48886b","importance":4,"narrative":"Updated the match assignment logic to include penalty shoot-out scores. This ensures that when match data is processed from the import queue, any penalty information is correctly persisted to the sportsMatches database schema.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Update assign-matches.ts to support home and away penalties","timestamp":"2026-06-01T15:54:53.261Z","title":"Add penalty score fields to match assignment logic","type":"file_edit"},"obs_mpve3lic_40be03cec470":{"concepts":["Drizzle ORM","SQL query refinement","PostgreSQL"],"confidence":0.9,"facts":["Updated database query in src/lib/server/teams.ts","Included homePenalties and awayPenalties fields from sportsMatches table"],"files":["src/lib/server/teams.ts"],"id":"obs_mpve3lic_40be03cec470","importance":4,"narrative":"The query in teams.ts was modified to fetch penalty data for matches. This update ensures that penalty outcomes are now available for downstream team statistical calculations.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Adding homePenalties and awayPenalties to the database query","timestamp":"2026-06-01T15:55:02.409Z","title":"Update match query to include penalty scores","type":"file_edit"},"obs_mpve3rf0_fa178d805f12":{"concepts":["TypeScript interfaces","data modeling","sports statistics schema"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Added penA (number | null) to handle shootout scores","Added penB (number | null) to handle shootout scores","Added decidedOnPens (boolean) to track if the tie required a shootout"],"files":["/Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/src/lib/server/teams.ts"],"id":"obs_mpve3rf0_fa178d805f12","importance":5,"narrative":"Updated the KnockoutLeg interface within the team statistics library to include data structures for penalty shootouts. This enables the system to correctly identify winners in ties that are decided by penalties rather than regulation or extra time aggregate scores.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Adding penalty shootout support to knockout match definitions","timestamp":"2026-06-01T15:55:10.066Z","title":"Update KnockoutLeg interface in teams.ts","type":"file_edit"},"obs_mpve41bl_861836d7202a":{"concepts":["business logic","tie-breaking algorithms","data aggregation"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Added penalty tracking (penA, penB) to aggregate match results.","Updated winner determination logic to prioritize aggregate score, then check penalties if aggregate is tied.","Included decidedOnPens boolean flag in return payload for frontend state differentiation."],"files":["/Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/src/lib/server/teams.ts"],"id":"obs_mpve41bl_861836d7202a","importance":6,"narrative":"The match aggregation logic was updated to account for tie-breaking penalty shootouts. The loop now captures penalty data from matches if available, and the winner selection logic now correctly favors the winner of a penalty shootout when the aggregate score is tied.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Updating match score calculation to support tie-breaker penalties","timestamp":"2026-06-01T15:55:22.904Z","title":"Implement penalty shootout logic in match aggregation","type":"file_edit"},"obs_mpve46ov_c3e1a940694f":{"concepts":["TypeScript interface","Astro components","Data modeling"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Added penA (number | null) to Tie interface","Added penB (number | null) to Tie interface","Added decidedOnPens (boolean) to Tie interface"],"files":["/Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/src/components/ligi/KnockoutBracket.astro"],"id":"obs_mpve46ov_c3e1a940694f","importance":5,"narrative":"Modified the TypeScript interface for Tie objects to include penalty shootout data. This ensures the component can handle and display match outcomes decided by penalties rather than aggregate scores alone.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Added penalty fields to support penalty shootouts","timestamp":"2026-06-01T15:55:29.862Z","title":"Update Tie interface in KnockoutBracket.astro","type":"file_edit"},"obs_mpve4d7t_5c3f70419c0a":{"concepts":["Astro components","Tailwind conditional rendering","UI state synchronization"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Added conditional rendering for penalty score (t.penA) in KnockoutBracket.astro","Condition checks both t.decidedOnPens and t.penA being non-null","Maintains existing layout logic for team display and total aggregate"],"files":["/Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/src/components/ligi/KnockoutBracket.astro"],"id":"obs_mpve4d7t_5c3f70419c0a","importance":4,"narrative":"Modified the bracket component to show penalty shootout results alongside the aggregate score for Team A. This provides necessary visual context for matches decided by penalties, using existing styling for consistent design.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Updating KnockoutBracket.astro to display penalty outcomes","timestamp":"2026-06-01T15:55:38.320Z","title":"Add penalty score display to KnockoutBracket","type":"file_edit"},"obs_mpve4kfb_1445b1f4ad3d":{"concepts":["Astro component","Conditional rendering","UI data visualization"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Added penalty score display for team B when decidedOnPens is true","Included a sub-label \"decis la penalty-uri\" when a penalty shootout occurred","Maintained consistent styling with existing theme variables (--sb-ink, --sb-ink-2)"],"files":["/Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/src/components/ligi/KnockoutBracket.astro"],"id":"obs_mpve4kfb_1445b1f4ad3d","importance":4,"narrative":"Modified the KnockoutBracket component to visually represent penalty shootout results for the second team (team B) in a tie. This includes displaying the penalty score in parentheses and adding a small informational text indicator below the score, improving transparency for knockout phase results.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Updating display for team B in knockout stage ties","timestamp":"2026-06-01T15:55:47.659Z","title":"Add penalty shootout indicators to KnockoutBracket","type":"file_edit"},"obs_mpve4tk6_cb7917afd209":{"concepts":["TypeScript interfaces","Data modeling","Sports domain modeling"],"confidence":0.9,"facts":["Added leaderRole union type ('leader' | 'holder') to TeamRecord interface","Included JSDoc comment clarifying semantic usage of leaderRole"],"files":["/Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/src/lib/server/teams.ts"],"id":"obs_mpve4tk6_cb7917afd209","importance":5,"narrative":"Modified the TeamRecord interface in src/lib/server/teams.ts to support differentiating between league leaders and cup holders. This metadata allows the frontend to correctly annotate teams based on their position in standings or competition results.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Adding metadata for league standings and cup winners","timestamp":"2026-06-01T15:55:59.501Z","title":"Update TeamRecord interface with leaderRole field","type":"file_edit"},"obs_mpve4zh7_af51d26d9848":{"concepts":["data normalization","API integration","array sorting"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Filters out \"General\" stages when a \"Regular Season\" stage exists to prevent redundancy.","Fetches competition seasons and standings for the primary stage identified by pickPrimary.","Sorts output primarily by country (\"Romania\" first) then alphabetically by country and parent name."],"files":["/Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/src/lib/server/teams.ts"],"id":"obs_mpve4zh7_af51d26d9848","importance":4,"narrative":"Examined the data processing loop in teams.ts which aggregates competition stages and identifies league leaders. This logic handles data normalization for Romanian fixtures and defines the ordering of the returned competition list.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Reviewing competition data aggregation in teams.ts","timestamp":"2026-06-01T15:56:07.170Z","title":"Read team grouping and sorting logic","type":"file_read"},"obs_mpve59ed_735186b95f0e":{"concepts":["data transformation","conditional logic","API data aggregation","sports statistics"],"confidence":1,"facts":["Added logic to detect knockout stages using stage label and type matching.","Implemented lookup for competition bracket finals to identify the trophy winner.","Updated output schema to include 'leaderRole' (leader vs holder) and associated trophy holder metadata.","Set 'leaderPoints' to null for cup winners as points are not applicable."],"files":["/Users/torel/code/2025/scoru/src/lib/server/teams.ts"],"id":"obs_mpve59ed_735186b95f0e","importance":6,"narrative":"The team aggregation logic was updated to better represent cup competitions. Instead of just displaying the top team by points, the code now checks for a knockout stage and prioritizes the winner of the latest final as the 'holder', providing a more accurate representation of competition status.","sessionId":"348be068-f172-4e96-a1c6-f633358ff2cc","subtitle":"Update team aggregation to distinguish between league leaders and cup winners","timestamp":"2026-06-01T15:56:20.025Z","title":"Implement trophy holder logic for cup competitions","type":"file_edit"}}␀�␀����